        <mxCell id="LnMEknaHHtvNX1RG8LR8-0" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Scenario Two:&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;A man goes on vacation with friends and is able to monitor his lawn&#39;s progress through a web application and schedule times sprinklers go on and off from a remote location.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;M2M: sprinklers turn on automatically when soil moisture level is too low.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; The system is able to get information from another system to get the &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;weather forecast.&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;M2P: The system is able to send information to the user about the lawn.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;P2P: The user is able to spend more time with his friends.&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="WIyWlLk6GJQsqaUBKTNV-1">
          <mxGeometry x="-799" y="39" width="400" height="240" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="LnMEknaHHtvNX1RG8LR8-3" value="&lt;h1&gt;Scenario Three:&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;A family enjoys a breakfast each morning. They often use milk in their breakfasts. whenever their milk runs out an order is made automatically through an online service and the family is able to enjoy their milk the next morning.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;M2M: The system is able to communicate with another system to order milk&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;M2P: The user is able to get recipes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;P2P: the family is able to enjoy a meal together&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="WIyWlLk6GJQsqaUBKTNV-1">
          <mxGeometry x="80" y="80" width="480" height="220" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
